ore value you can add to  somebody's life the more you're helping  them out the more money you're gonna  make the more of an impact you're gonna  have the more people are gonna pay you  to solve this problem for them so you  may like sitting down and playing video  games all day but if that's not adding  value to somebody's life then you're not  gonna be able to turn into a business  so if all the ideas that you wrote down  try to score them try to think about  which one has the most value  and the most successful business idea  that will come from that is the one that  matches up with something that you love  doing  and has a lot of value you can combine  those two things that is your powerful  winning business idea  i went through the same thing with my  business so when i sold my software  company i didn't know what i wanted to  do i didn't have to go work but i wanted  to work i i like work  and i was trying to figure out what kind  of business do i want to start and i  realized that i really loved helping  entrepreneurs  i could start talking entrepreneurs and  lose complete track of time if i feel  like i'm helping them with their  business or they're giving me ideas i  just love entrepreneurs  maybe i'm the crazy one i don't know i  love it i love hanging out entrepreneurs  i love talking to you guys  i lose track of time it makes my day  every day  i didn't know how to turn into a  business yet but i knew it had to be  something around helping entrepreneurs  and i played with my business model and  i found different ways to make it work i  started a website so now we have over 20  million people visited the website  i've done some coaching and consulting  work i've done some paid blog posts i've  sold advertising i've  tested out products for different  companies that still relate to  entrepreneurship so i've created this  little empire around helping  entrepreneurs because it's something i  believe in and i love doing  so  it's something i can get lost in so it  meets the first criteria and it adds a  lot of value to other people's lives  other entrepreneurs right why are you  watching this video why do i make these  videos because i love entrepreneurs i  love helping you guys out i love hearing  your questions i want to see you be  successful i want to see you build a  huge company  follow your dreams make some magic  happen change the world i love that  stuff  and so i surround that with me every day  i surround myself with that and so you  want to do the same thing with with  whatever business you start so finding  your passion you should get excited like  i just got excited right you heard the  passion come out in my voice you should  get excited for whatever it is that  you're gonna start to do  so go through that process  go through those steps that i mentioned  come down to the one idea that you love  and  adds a lot of value to people's lives  and you're on track to build a  successful company  i know it's hard i know it's challenging  i know  i know you want to start a business  right we want to want to get started we  want to wait don't want to go you know  spend all this time coming up with an  idea you want to get started now you  want to live the entrepreneurial  lifestyle i get it  you want to make sure you do it right  most businesses fail right eighty  percent of businesses fail in five years  eighty percent it's crazy  and a lot of them don't take enough time  on this first step  finding their passion figuring out what  they're excited about and building a  business around it  so congrats on taking the time to figure  that out  good luck  and believe  thank you everyone for watching if you  liked the video please give it that  thumbs up below makes me want to do more  for you and i want to hear what you have  to think please leave a comment under  this video or if you have a question for  your own company leave a comment below  and i will make a video response for you  thank you and i'll see you soon
 

